<title>ARGENTINA: Argentine grain/oilseed stocks on Sept 1.</title>
<headline>Argentine grain/oilseed stocks on Sept 1.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1996-10-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Argentine Agriculture Secretariat figures for domestic grain stocks on Sept 1 in tonnes, followed by figures for a month earlier and a year earlier:</p>
<p> Bread wheat    1,684,409	 2,118,270	 1,374,533</p>
<p> Maize	    2,234,161	 2,939,697	 2,124,079</p>
<p> Sorghum	    176,777	   197,727	   182,244</p>
<p> Barley	     132,483	   158,782	    85,981</p>
</text>
